{"page":580,"width":1741,"height":2656,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"복구 643","words":[{"text":"복구","x":1359,"y":166,"width":46,"height":26},{"text":"643","x":1475,"y":161,"width":58,"height":30}]},{"text":"14.7","words":[{"text":"14.7","x":1275,"y":166,"width":69,"height":23}]},{"text":"김출을 위해서 각 파일 시스템의 모든 메타데이터에 대한 검사를 통하여 파일 시스템의","words":[{"text":"김출을","x":307,"y":292,"width":94,"height":37},{"text":"위해서","x":416,"y":294,"width":90,"height":37},{"text":"각","x":524,"y":294,"width":30,"height":37},{"text":"파일","x":567,"y":294,"width":59,"height":37},{"text":"시스템의","x":642,"y":294,"width":115,"height":38},{"text":"모든","x":773,"y":298,"width":59,"height":33},{"text":"메타데이터에","x":846,"y":294,"width":180,"height":39},{"text":"대한","x":1043,"y":295,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"검사를","x":1117,"y":294,"width":91,"height":37},{"text":"통하여","x":1220,"y":295,"width":91,"height":37},{"text":"파일","x":1328,"y":294,"width":61,"height":37},{"text":"시스템의","x":1406,"y":294,"width":124,"height":39}]},{"text":"일관성을 확인하거나 부정할 수 있다. 불행하게도 이 검사는 몇 분에서 몇 시간이 소요","words":[{"text":"일관성을","x":307,"y":353,"width":126,"height":37},{"text":"확인하거나","x":448,"y":354,"width":156,"height":38},{"text":"부정할","x":617,"y":355,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":720,"y":356,"width":30,"height":36},{"text":"있다.","x":766,"y":356,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"불행하게도","x":845,"y":356,"width":154,"height":36},{"text":"이","x":1013,"y":356,"width":25,"height":36},{"text":"검사는","x":1057,"y":355,"width":91,"height":37},{"text":"몇","x":1163,"y":356,"width":26,"height":36},{"text":"분에서","x":1205,"y":356,"width":91,"height":37},{"text":"몇","x":1315,"y":356,"width":28,"height":36},{"text":"시간이","x":1360,"y":355,"width":91,"height":37},{"text":"소요","x":1469,"y":359,"width":64,"height":29}]},{"text":"되며 시스템이 부트될 때마다 실행되어야 한다. 대체 방안으로 파일 시스템은 파일 시스","words":[{"text":"되며","x":306,"y":413,"width":59,"height":37},{"text":"시스템이","x":383,"y":414,"width":123,"height":37},{"text":"부트될","x":522,"y":415,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"때마다","x":627,"y":415,"width":89,"height":36},{"text":"실행되어야","x":729,"y":416,"width":150,"height":36},{"text":"한다.","x":890,"y":416,"width":67,"height":36},{"text":"대체","x":974,"y":416,"width":55,"height":37},{"text":"방안으로","x":1046,"y":416,"width":120,"height":37},{"text":"파일","x":1179,"y":416,"width":60,"height":37},{"text":"시스템은","x":1254,"y":417,"width":126,"height":36},{"text":"파일","x":1392,"y":417,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"시스","x":1470,"y":417,"width":63,"height":37}]},{"text":"템 메타데이터 안에 자신의 상태를 기록할 수 있다. 메타데이터를 변경하려고 할 때 이","words":[{"text":"템","x":306,"y":474,"width":27,"height":36},{"text":"메타데이터","x":352,"y":474,"width":155,"height":38},{"text":"안에","x":526,"y":475,"width":58,"height":37},{"text":"자신의","x":601,"y":475,"width":87,"height":37},{"text":"상태를","x":705,"y":475,"width":89,"height":37},{"text":"기록할","x":810,"y":476,"width":89,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":911,"y":477,"width":31,"height":35},{"text":"있다.","x":958,"y":477,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"메타데이터를","x":1039,"y":477,"width":183,"height":37},{"text":"변경하려고","x":1239,"y":478,"width":155,"height":36},{"text":"할","x":1409,"y":477,"width":33,"height":37},{"text":"때","x":1456,"y":478,"width":28,"height":36},{"text":"이","x":1503,"y":478,"width":27,"height":37}]},{"text":"상대 비트는 메타데이터가 변경 중 상태라는 것을 표시하도록 설정되어야 한다. 메타데","words":[{"text":"상대","x":305,"y":535,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"비트는","x":385,"y":535,"width":94,"height":37},{"text":"메타데이터가","x":494,"y":536,"width":184,"height":37},{"text":"변경","x":692,"y":536,"width":54,"height":36},{"text":"중","x":763,"y":537,"width":30,"height":36},{"text":"상태라는","x":806,"y":536,"width":121,"height":37},{"text":"것을","x":942,"y":537,"width":58,"height":36},{"text":"표시하도록","x":1013,"y":538,"width":152,"height":36},{"text":"설정되어야","x":1179,"y":538,"width":158,"height":37},{"text":"한다.","x":1349,"y":539,"width":70,"height":36},{"text":"메타데","x":1437,"y":538,"width":94,"height":37}]},{"text":"이터에 대한 모든 갱신이 성공적으로 완료되면, 파일 시스템은 이 비트를 소거한다. 그러","words":[{"text":"이터에","x":306,"y":596,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"대한","x":414,"y":596,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"모든","x":488,"y":598,"width":63,"height":34},{"text":"갱신이","x":564,"y":596,"width":86,"height":37},{"text":"성공적으로","x":666,"y":596,"width":150,"height":36},{"text":"완료되면,","x":827,"y":597,"width":128,"height":38},{"text":"파일","x":968,"y":598,"width":58,"height":37},{"text":"시스템은","x":1040,"y":599,"width":120,"height":36},{"text":"이","x":1173,"y":599,"width":25,"height":36},{"text":"비트를","x":1216,"y":600,"width":91,"height":36},{"text":"소거한다.","x":1319,"y":600,"width":134,"height":36},{"text":"그러","x":1468,"y":600,"width":62,"height":37}]},{"text":"나 상태 비트가 1로 남아 있으면, 일관성 검사가 수행된다.","words":[{"text":"나","x":305,"y":657,"width":32,"height":36},{"text":"상태","x":348,"y":656,"width":61,"height":37},{"text":"비트가","x":426,"y":657,"width":94,"height":36},{"text":"1로","x":532,"y":661,"width":48,"height":28},{"text":"남아","x":592,"y":657,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"있으면,","x":665,"y":657,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"일관성","x":776,"y":658,"width":84,"height":37},{"text":"검사가","x":877,"y":658,"width":89,"height":37},{"text":"수행된다.","x":977,"y":659,"width":127,"height":37}]},{"text":"UNIX 시스템의 fsck와 같은 일관성 검사기(consistency checker)는 디렉터리","words":[{"text":"UNIX","x":364,"y":721,"width":96,"height":30},{"text":"시스템의","x":478,"y":718,"width":123,"height":37},{"text":"fsck와","x":620,"y":718,"width":106,"height":36},{"text":"같은","x":740,"y":718,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"일관성","x":818,"y":720,"width":85,"height":36},{"text":"검사기(consistency","x":923,"y":720,"width":280,"height":44},{"text":"checker)는","x":1218,"y":724,"width":169,"height":38},{"text":"디렉터리","x":1404,"y":722,"width":124,"height":38}]},{"text":"구조에 있는 데이터와 다른 메타데이터를 저장장文1에 있는 상태와 비교하고 불일치가","words":[{"text":"구조에","x":304,"y":779,"width":94,"height":37},{"text":"있는","x":419,"y":779,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"데이터와","x":497,"y":779,"width":127,"height":37},{"text":"다른","x":639,"y":779,"width":60,"height":37},{"text":"메타데이터를","x":715,"y":779,"width":183,"height":39},{"text":"저장장文1에","x":914,"y":781,"width":147,"height":37},{"text":"있는","x":1080,"y":782,"width":58,"height":36},{"text":"상태와","x":1152,"y":783,"width":95,"height":36},{"text":"비교하고","x":1262,"y":783,"width":125,"height":37},{"text":"불일치가","x":1402,"y":784,"width":131,"height":37}]},{"text":"발견되면 그것을 복-구하도록 시도한다. 이때 할당 및 가용 공간 관리 알고리즘이 이 검","words":[{"text":"발견되면","x":304,"y":840,"width":128,"height":36},{"text":"그것을","x":448,"y":840,"width":95,"height":36},{"text":"복-구하도록","x":556,"y":841,"width":156,"height":36},{"text":"시도한다.","x":726,"y":841,"width":127,"height":37},{"text":"이때","x":871,"y":842,"width":55,"height":37},{"text":"할당","x":943,"y":842,"width":60,"height":37},{"text":"및","x":1018,"y":843,"width":26,"height":36},{"text":"가용","x":1060,"y":843,"width":59,"height":37},{"text":"공간","x":1132,"y":844,"width":60,"height":36},{"text":"관리","x":1205,"y":844,"width":58,"height":36},{"text":"알고리즘이","x":1281,"y":844,"width":154,"height":36},{"text":"이","x":1455,"y":845,"width":27,"height":37},{"text":"검","x":1501,"y":846,"width":27,"height":35}]},{"text":"사기가 발견할 수 있는 문제의 유형과 이들을 얼마나 성공적으로 회복할 수 있는지를 결","words":[{"text":"사기가","x":303,"y":901,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"발견할","x":413,"y":901,"width":97,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":520,"y":901,"width":33,"height":36},{"text":"있는","x":567,"y":901,"width":60,"height":37},{"text":"문제의","x":639,"y":902,"width":89,"height":37},{"text":"유형과","x":743,"y":902,"width":93,"height":37},{"text":"이들을","x":848,"y":903,"width":90,"height":37},{"text":"얼마나","x":950,"y":904,"width":89,"height":36},{"text":"성공적으로","x":1050,"y":904,"width":150,"height":37},{"text":"회복할","x":1213,"y":905,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":1315,"y":906,"width":33,"height":35},{"text":"있는지를","x":1362,"y":905,"width":126,"height":37},{"text":"결","x":1501,"y":906,"width":29,"height":36}]},{"text":"정한다. 예를 들면, 만일 연결 할당이 사용되고 모든 블록이 다음 블록에 대한 링크를 가","wor